body:
@PhoebeHui I was able to test your suggestion on our CI build and found that it succeeded when we included `-DCMAKE_DISABLE_FIND_PACKAGE_HarfBuzz=TRUE` as well as the line you suggested - my implementation is as listed here:
https://github.com/capnkenny/vcpkg/blob/master/ports/freetype/portfile.cmake#L41

Please note that based on the implementation from above, this was only needed for Ubuntu x64 and x86 as the current implementation works as-is for Windows.
